    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d981">

                <pb facs="1000" n="880" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg880"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Leishman to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-05-22"><hi rendition="#italic">May 22,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1070.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to inclose herewith copy of statement
                    received through the British embassy, showing awards allotted to American
                    claimants by the Cretan commission.</p>
                <p>In reply to my question as to when, where, and how the money was to be paid, the
                    English ambassador smilingly remarked that “that is a matter for the
                    future.”</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John G. A.
                    Leishman.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d981-a1.xml" xpointer="d981-a1"/>
